      "dot": "emerald",
      "title": "Feature-Sliced Modules",
      "items": [
        "5 isolated domain slices: home, about, projects, skills, and contact",
        "Static typed repositories in data/*.data.ts decouple content from UI widgets",
        "Interactive category filtering (All, Trading, Web, Mobile, Other) and image carousels"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "rose",
      "title": "Hardened Contact API",
      "items": [
        "In-memory IP rate limiter restricts submissions to 3 requests per 10-minute window",
        "Hidden honeypot input silently neutralizes automated bot submissions",
